{"id":"word:hebrew:H759","type":"word","title":"אַרְמוֹן","subtitle":"H759 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a citadel (from its height )","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אַרְמוֹן (H759) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 32 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אַרְמוֹן (ʼarmôwn) means a citadel (from its height ) First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 16 18."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אַרְמוֹן","transliteration":"ʼarmôwn","pronunciation":"ar-mone'","strong":"H759","lemmaId":"hebrew:H759","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["אַרְמְנ֥וֹת","אַרְמְנֹתֶֽי/הָ","אַרְמְנוֹתֶ֑י/הָ","אַרְמ֣וֹן","אַרְמְנ֣וֹת"],"morphs":[["HNcmpc/Sp3fs",11],["HNcmpc",6],["HNcmsc",2],["HNcmpa",2],["HNcmsa",2],["HR/Ncmpc/Sp1cp",2],["HR/Ncmsc",1],["HR/Ncmpc/Sp3mp",1],["HNcmpc/Sp2fs",1],["HC/Ncmpc/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a citadel (from its height )","usage":"castle, palace. Compare 2038 .","full":"H759. armon אַרְמוֺן noun masculine Isa 32:14 citadel — ׳א absolute Jer 30:18 +; construct Isa 25:2 ; plural אַרְמְנוֺת absolute Amos 3:9 (twice in verse); construct 1:4 +; אַרְמְנוֺתֵינוּ Micah 5:4 +, etc. — citadel, castle, palace , not used before royal period, mostly in prophets, especially common in Amos & Jeremiah; citadel as securely barred (in simile) Prov 18:19 ; ׳א הַמֶּלֶךְ בֵּית i.e. the citadel, stronghold 1Kin 16:18 , compare 2Kin 15:25 ; usually more General, of castle, palaces , prominent buildings; especially used in speaking of conquest, because the fine buildings would be especially object of attack & plunder; palaces of Israel Amos 6:8 ; of Jerusalem Isa 32:14 (singular collective) Lam 2:5 , 7 ; 2Chr 36:19 ; Psa 48:4 ; 48:14 ; 122:7 compare Hosea 8:14 ; Micah 5:4 ; Amos 2:5 ; Jer 17:27 ; of Samaria Amos 3:10-11 , also Jer 6:5 ; 9:20 belonging to Benhadad (i.e. Aram) Amos 1:4 ; Jer 49:27 ; of Tyre Isa 23:13 ; Amos 1:10 ; of Babylon Isa 25:2 (singular collective), compare 13:22 where read אַרְמְנוֺתָיו for אלמנותיו so ᵑ9 ᵑ7 ᵑ6 Che Di (|| היכלים ; compare Ezek 19:7 according to ᵑ7 and others, but see rather מעון ; Dl BD xi defends ᵑ0 in 19:7 & compare Assyrian almattu , fortress ); of Edom Isa 34:13 , of Gaza Amos 1:7 , of Rabbah 1:14 , of Bozrah 1:12 , of Kerioth 2:2 , of Ashdod 3:9 , of Egypt 3:9 .","rootNote":"from an unused root (meaning to be elevated );","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 16 18","keyReferences":["1Kgs 16 18","2Chr 36 19","2Kgs 15 25","Amos 1 4","Amos 1 7","Amos 1 10","Amos 1 12","Amos 1 14"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":32,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 16 18","book":"1Kgs","chapter":16,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְמ֣וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 36 19","book":"2Chr","chapter":36,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְמְנוֹתֶ֨י/הָ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"2Kgs 15 25","book":"2Kgs","chapter":15,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/אַרְמ֤וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Amos 1 4","book":"Amos","chapter":1,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְמְנ֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Amos 1 7","book":"Amos","chapter":1,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְמְנֹתֶֽי/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Amos 1 10","book":"Amos","chapter":1,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְמְנֹתֶֽי/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Amos 1 12","book":"Amos","chapter":1,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְמְנ֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Amos 1 14","book":"Amos","chapter":1,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְמְנוֹתֶ֑י/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Amos 2 2","book":"Amos","chapter"